# Packages that pacstrap/main.py of the pinned installer (cachyos-calamares-next 3.4.2-13, CachyOS/cachyos-calamares @ 199d715) appends
# to basePackages IN CODE. modules/pacstrap.conf cannot change them, so they are listed here, once, and read by lib/ci-pkglist.py
# next to basePackages: the launcher's package preflight (calamares-online.sh) then asks `pacman -Si` for the whole base system, not
# only for the part the overlay's YAML names, BEFORE the installer touches a disk.
#
# The `code-names` guard of guards.list compares this file with the installer's main.py (both ways): a name the code adds that is
# not listed, or listed and no longer added, makes the guard critical, so an installer update that changes the set is reviewed
# (the launcher keeps the installer on the ISO) instead of leaving names unchecked. Bumping the installer pin: read the diff of
# main.py, update this file, `check-packages.py` (every name below except `unused` is checked against the repositories).
#
# Format: set | package | when the installer adds it        (one package per line; "#" starts a comment)
#   always   the install needs it: the preflight fails, and the launcher stops, when the package is gone from the repositories
#   optional only some installs need it (a filesystem, a platform): the preflight warns, the install goes on
#   unused   added only on a path this edition cannot take (the bootloader chooser offers GRUB only): listed so the guard knows it,
#            not checked against the repositories
#
always   | linux-cachyos                   | kernels of a non-handheld target
always   | linux-cachyos-headers
always   | linux-cachyos-lts
always   | linux-cachyos-lts-headers
always   | grub                            | bootloader chooser = grub (the only item)
always   | grub-hook
always   | cachyos-grub-theme               | removed again by scripts/ci-os-post-install-fixups.sh
always   | os-prober
always   | intel-ucode                     | CPU vendor_id is GenuineIntel (read from /proc/cpuinfo at install time)
always   | amd-ucode                       | any other vendor: both are checked, the vendor of the machine is not known to the preflight
optional | snapper                         | root filesystem is Btrfs (with GRUB)
optional | btrfs-assistant
optional | grub-btrfs-support
optional | zfs-utils                       | root filesystem is ZFS
optional | linux-cachyos-zfs
optional | linux-cachyos-lts-zfs
optional | bcachefs-tools                  | root filesystem is bcachefs
optional | bcachefs-dkms
optional | linux-cachyos-deckify           | target platform is handheld
optional | linux-cachyos-deckify-headers
optional | linux-cachyos-deckify-zfs
unused   | limine                          | other bootloaders: not offered by modules/packagechooser_bootloader.conf
unused   | limine-entry-tool
unused   | limine-snapper-sync
unused   | refind
unused   | refind-btrfs
unused   | systemd-boot-manager
